- [Kelly] Okay.

00:00:23.733 --> 00:00:24.566
- So she-

00:00:24.566 --> 00:00:25.499
- [Kelly] And a dream-

00:00:25.499 --> 00:00:26.332
- And a dream, yeah.
- Okay.

00:00:26.332 --> 00:00:29.240
