00:00:32.438 --> 00:00:33.271
- [Kelly] Aww.

00:00:33.271 --> 00:00:34.280
- [Niecy] That was a long time ago.

00:00:34.280 --> 00:00:35.260
- [Kelly] Is that her?

00:00:35.260 --> 00:00:36.093
- [Niecy] Oh, yeah.

00:00:36.093 --> 00:00:37.353
