00:00:59.650 --> 00:01:01.210
I'm like, "Y'all get up there
and do something for me".

00:01:01.210 --> 00:01:02.632
- Aww...
- Yeah.

00:01:02.632 --> 00:01:03.862
And so-
- I love that.

00:01:03.862 --> 00:01:04.695
(audience clapping)
- I love that too.

00:01:04.695 --> 00:01:05.950
